      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِيلَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>slaying covertly,</i> (Mgh,) or <i>on an
occasion of inadvertence;</i> a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِغْتَالَهُ</span>:
(Msb:) originally with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِوْلَةٌ</span>]. (S.) See
8: and see also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غيل</span>.

